    "text": "<p>Match List I with List II</p><table border=\"1\" cellpadding=\"1\" cellspacing=\"1\" style=\"width: 500px;\">\t<tbody>\t\t<tr>\t\t\t<td>&nbsp;</td>\t\t\t<td>List</td>\t\t\t<td>&nbsp;</td>\t\t\t<td>List II</td>\t\t</tr>\t\t<tr>\t\t\t<td>A</td>\t\t\t<td>Young&#39;s Modulus <math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mo>(</mo><mi>Y</mi><mo>)</mo></math></td>\t\t\t<td>I</td>\t\t\t<td><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mo>[</mo><msup><mi>ML</mi><mrow><mo>&#8211;</mo><mn>1</mn></mrow></msup><mo>&#160;</mo><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">T</mi><msup><mo>&#160;</mo><mrow><mo>&#8211;</mo><mn>1</mn></mrow></msup><mo>]</mo></math></td>\t\t</tr>\t\t<tr>\t\t\t<td>B</td>\t\t\t<td>Co-efficient of Viscosity <math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mo>(</mo><mi>&#951;</mi><mo>)</mo></math></td>\t\t\t<td>II</td>\t\t\t<td><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mo>[</mo><msup><mi>ML</mi><mn>2</mn></msup><mo>&#160;</mo><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">T</mi><msup><mo>&#160;</mo><mrow><mo>&#8211;</mo><mn>1</mn></mrow></msup><mo>]</mo></math></td>\t\t</tr>\t\t<tr>\t\t\t<td>C</td>\t\t\t<td>Planck&#39;s Constant <math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mo>(</mo><mi>h</mi><mo>)</mo></math></td>\t\t\t<td>III</td>\t\t\t<td><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mo>[</mo><msup><mi>ML</mi><mrow><mo>&#8211;</mo><mn>1</mn></mrow></msup><mo>&#160;</mo><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">T</mi><msup><mo>&#160;</mo><mrow><mo>&#8211;</mo><mn>2</mn></mrow></msup><mo>]</mo></math></td>\t\t</tr>\t\t<tr>\t\t\t<td>D</td>\t\t\t<td>Work Function <math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mfenced><mi>&#981;</mi></mfenced></math></td>\t\t\t<td>IV</td>\t\t\t<td><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mo>[</mo><msup><mi>ML</mi><mn>2</mn></msup><mo>&#160;</mo><msup><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">T</mi><mrow><mo>&#8211;</mo><mn>2</mn></mrow></msup><mo>]</mo></math></td>\t\t</tr>\t</tbody></table><p>Choose the correct answer from the options given below:</p>",
